cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in academic work, please cite it as below."
type: software

title: "Carbon Capture Technology Screening Tool"
version: "1.8.8"
date-released: "2026-05-12"

abstract: >
  Route-first pre-FEED screening platform for industrial CO2 capture
  technology selection across four families: absorption, adsorption,
  membrane, and cryogenic. Database V5 backed by 20+ peer-reviewed
  TEA studies. Validated against Roussanaly 2017 (MEA cement €83/t),
  Meerman 2012 (Selexol SMR €41/t), and Varnier 2025 (cryogenic
  cement 0.33 MWh/tCO2). Outputs LCOC, specific energy, and
  confidence-labelled rankings for all feasible routes.

